OL,3,GNEWSAColdest night of autumn so far
OL,4,Afollowed by snow warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coldest night of the autumn in the
OL,7,FUK so far has been recorded in the
OL,8,FHighlands ahead of a first warning of
OL,9,Fthe season for snowfalls in the south
OL,10,Fof the country.
OL,12,FThe Met Office said the temperature
OL,13,Fdipped to -7.7C at Tulloch Bridge in
OL,14,FLochaber.
OL,16,FIts alert for snow covers the north of
OL,17,FEngland along with Dumfries and
OL,18,FGalloway, Midlothian, the Scottish
OL,19,FBorders and parts of South and East
OL,20,FAyrshire and South Lanarkshire from
OL,21,Fmidnight to 11:00 on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
